    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "\"1. Whether the learned Commissioner below erred in law rtby dismissing the claim\napplication solely on the basis of an unregistered affidavit of sale, without\nconsidering that the registered owner continued to be the statutory owner and\nemployer under the Motor Vehicles Act, 1988?",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 459,
      "end": 742,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Motor Vehicles Act, 1988",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 717,
          "end": 741
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "2.  Whether a mere affidavit or unregistered sale document, without compliance with Section 50 of the Motor Vehicles Act, is sufficient in law to absolve the registered owner of liability under the Employee's Compensation Act, 1923?",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 743,
      "end": 976,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 50",
          "label": "PROVISION",
