          "end": 838
        },
        {
          "text": "Motor Vehicles Act",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 846,
          "end": 864
        },
        {
          "text": "Employee's Compensation Act, 1923",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 942,
          "end": 975
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "6. Whether the registered ownership of the vehicle at the time of the accident creates a rebuttable presumption of employer-employee relationship and liability for compensation, which was not rebutted by cogent evidence in the present case?\nCall for the records.",
